  "title": "Division Word Problems: Vans Needed",
  "intro": "Teach students to decide whether a remainder requires an additional group.",
  "html": "<h2>Teaching notes for parents and teachers</h2><h3>How to teach it</h3><p>Use seats or counters to represent full vans and students still waiting. Count the smallest number of vans that can carry everyone.</p><h3>Example to work through together</h3><p>Use the model below as you explain the example. Have your student point to the quantities as you discuss them.</p><div class=\"model vehicle-seat-model\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Nineteen students need four six-seat vans\" style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><svg role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Three vans each seat six students, and the fourth seats one student with five empty places\" viewBox=\"0 0 600 170\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;min-width:600px\"><title>All nineteen students need a seat</title><g class=\"van-group\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"15\" width=\"135\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"77\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Van 1</text><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"40\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"77\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"114\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"40\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"77\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"114\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"van-group\"><rect x=\"156\" y=\"15\" width=\"135\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"223\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Van 2</text><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"186\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"223\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"260\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"186\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"223\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"260\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"van-group\"><rect x=\"302\" y=\"15\" width=\"135\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"369\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Van 3</text><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"332\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"369\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"406\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"332\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"369\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"406\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"van-group\"><rect x=\"448\" y=\"15\" width=\"135\" height=\"110\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"515\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"16\">Van 4</text><circle class=\"occupied-seat\" cx=\"478\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"#176e5c\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"empty-seat\" cx=\"515\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"empty-seat\" cx=\"552\" cy=\"67\" r=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"empty-seat\" cx=\"478\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"empty-seat\" cx=\"515\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle class=\"empty-seat\" cx=\"552\" cy=\"99\" r=\"11\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"#164f5b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text x=\"300\" y=\"153\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#164f5b\" font-size=\"17\">Filled circles: students · Empty circles: unused seats</text></svg><p>Three full vans carry 18 students. The remaining student needs a seat in a fourth van. There are 24 student places in all, with 5 unused.</p></div><div class=\"model\"><p class=\"sample-equation\">4 × 6 = 24 ≥ 19</p><p>Four vans have enough student places.</p><p class=\"sample-equation\">3 × 6 = 18 &lt; 19</p><p>Three vans do not.</p></div><h3>Ask your student</h3><blockquote><p>Can the students left over travel without another van?</p></blockquote><h3>If your student needs help</h3><p>If the student reports only the whole-number quotient, ask them to seat every remaining student.</p>",
